# Topic branches merged into quattro and stacked into asus/stack, in this order.
# <branch> <kind> <draft>
#   kind: pr     = written to be opened on omacom/omarchy as it is
#         carry  = someone else's open upstream pull request, carried until it merges
#         fork   = stays in the fork (model-specific policy, or upstream said no)
#   draft: the pull request text under fork/prs/
# A branch whose commits upstream already has is reported by fork/sync and can be removed here.

